    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Да.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes.' A crisp, everyday conversational reply meaning 'yes' that you will hear constantly in Russian dialogue.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Я так рад.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am so glad.' Max combines 'I' with 'glad' in a natural Russian turn of phrase.",
